    "title": "Merced (CA) Receives Funding for New Ladder Truck - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tribune Content Agency ,\n18 hours ago Jim Silva – Merced Sun-Star (Merced, Calif.) The state of California has awarded Merced two big financial investments, according to a news release from the city on Tuesday. The state awarded $5 million to help with the Bear Creek Infrastructure and Flood Protection project. It also gave the city $1.5 million toward a new ladder truck for the Merced Fire Department. Read full article\n1",
